      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PERCEPTION (1) stuck on well last time to finish a nose back in second (19.10) at this track in a Mix 5 over 350m. Deserves serious consideration. SUPER WINE (6) struggled to get involved last start after losing his position early at this track, but prior to that won by half a length at this track (16.62) beating Cake Is Yummy in a P5 on July 13. Comes through a solid form race last start. Can figure in the finish. SCOTCH AND BYE (7) hit the ground running from out wide with a fast early sectional but run over late and missed the frame when a 1.3 lengths fourth (19.20) over 350m at this track. Has performed well from this box with a win and two minor placings to her name from six starts. Has ability and can measure up. WARREGO RAIN (4) drops in trip and can play a major role.",
